WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.081 --> 00:00:03.627
What's going on?

2
00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:11.797
Is Polly tying wood to her feet?

3
00:00:11.798 --> 00:00:16.805
Polly: Yes! Our new shoes are perfect.

4
00:00:16.806 --> 00:00:19.456
Polly: We'll sound just like a goat!

5
00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:23.053
Polly: Remember to stomp really hard, Jack.

6
00:00:23.054 --> 00:00:36.620
Jack: I'll try . . .

7
00:00:36.621 --> 00:00:47.947
Ogre: Huh? Who's that trip-trapping across my bridge?

8
00:00:47.948 --> 00:00:52.340
Polly: It's me—the biggest goat brother!

9
00:00:52.341 --> 00:00:56.213
Jack: And I hate mean ogres!

10
00:00:56.214 --> 00:00:59.078
Jack: So, scram, Ogre!

11
00:00:59.079 --> 00:01:06.869
Jack: This is my bridge now! Grrr!

12
00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:17.044
Ogre: Oh no! That goat looks really scary!

13
00:01:17.045 --> 00:01:25.903
Jack: We did it, Polly!

14
00:01:25.904 --> 00:01:28.742
Small Goat: Yay!

15
00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:30.265
Medium Goat: Thank you.

16
00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:49.971
Polly: No problem!

17
00:01:49.972 --> 00:01:53.792
Jack: The kite for Gary looks great.

18
00:01:53.793 --> 00:01:58.134
Polly: But we still need to decorate it.

19
00:01:58.135 --> 00:02:02.378
Omar: You could add this picture.

20
00:02:02.379 --> 00:02:04.434
Jack: It's an owl!

21
00:02:04.435 --> 00:02:12.362
Polly: Just like you, Omar. I like it.

22
00:02:12.363 --> 00:02:19.658
Omar: Tell Gary I say, "Happy Birthday."

23
00:02:19.659 --> 00:02:22.848
Polly and Jack: You know Gary?

24
00:02:22.849 --> 00:02:49.946
Omar: Have fun at the party!

25
00:02:49.947 --> 00:02:55.863
Gary: This is a terrible birthday.

26
00:02:55.864 --> 00:02:58.522
Gary: Where is everyone?

27
00:02:58.523 --> 00:03:01.969
Gary: Nobody remembered that today is—

28
00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:10.522
Everyone: Happy Birthday, Gary!

29
00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:17.833
Gary: Wow! You did all this for me?

30
00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:19.601
Jack: Of course.

31
00:03:19.602 --> 00:03:21.677
Polly: It's what family does.

32
00:03:21.678 --> 00:03:39.654
Polly: Even for a grumpy goose!

